on x86, not 127x, and `search_restoration_still_bd` is 3.2-7.7 % of the
port's preset-6 frame, not 33-55 %. The p6 port/C ratio on all four contents
is 2.30-2.75x (was 3.40-5.79x), and removing the LR search now moves it by
0.05-0.13x instead of by 1.1-3.2x. LOOP RESTORATION IS NO LONGER THE p6
