=================== 4. WHAT IS BIGGEST AT p6 NOW ===================

Two views, because inclusive edges nest and self costs do not. Ir shares are
callgrind's, not wall clock — and this campaign has already measured one
case (`perf-status.md`'s CFL banner) where fewer instructions were SLOWER.
Rank by this, decide by wall clock.

